			"notes": "- 1.8.9: the sky browser now opens inside the OneConfig menu, built with OneConfig's own cards, buttons and search (search filters skies). The old screen is still used if PolyCompose's UI is turned off\n- New: Sky Lighting (Sky → Lighting, off by default). The world's outdoor light picks up the sky's colour, so a purple sky gives a purple glow; torch-lit areas keep their own colour. On 1.8.9 and all Fabric versions\n- Modern Fabric: the sky no longer picks up stray graphics state left by other mods\n- 1.8.9 now needs OneConfig 1.9.5 or newer, PolyCompose 3.0.9 or newer, and Fabric Language Kotlin\n- 26.1, 26.2 and 26.3 builds are paused for this release while a sky rendering bug there is fixed. Builds: 1.8.9, 1.21.1, 1.21.4, 1.21.5, 1.21.8, 1.21.10, 1.21.11"
		},
